D is its Keychain application tag (after ","type":"text"},{"code":"Options.tagPrefix","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"), and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"its label names its purpose. Holder keys also agree keys (ECDH), for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"deviceMac in person: a P-256 key in the Secure Enclave or the Keychain","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"can, with nothing asked of it at creation.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"KeychainKeyStore","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/PresentingToSafari":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/presentingtosafari","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/PresentingToSafari","type":"topic","role":"article","kind":"article","abstract":[{"text":"Answer a web page’s request for an mdoc over the Digital Credentials","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"API, as an iOS document provider.","type":"text"}],"title":"Presenting to Safari"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletError/Code-swift.struct/platform":{"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walleterror\/code-swift.struct\/platform","abstract":[{"text":"A key store, credential store or Wallet Provider call failed; its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"message follows.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/platform","fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"platform","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"WalletError","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet11WalletE